   "soul": "#0055ff",
   "text": "When the Tongues first woke their altars, the light had to be held while Alduin's dead came for it. At night, step into the light of the Echo Altar of {city}: it begins to draw in toward the stone, and every one of the risen in the city comes for you. Stay inside the ring until it closes on the stone. Step out and the light falters and slips back.",
